{
  "_comment": "Blockable website categories. Ids and order must match WEB_CATEGORIES in backend/app/core/catalog.py (checked by backend/tests/test_web_filter.py). Lists are built into rulesets/<id>.json by scripts/update-web-categories.js. A source that is a file name comes from the HaGeZi DNS blocklists (GPL-3.0, source_base); a full https:// address from the UT1 blacklists of Université Toulouse Capitole (CC BY-SA 4.0); see rulesets/LICENSE-DATA.md. AgentShield's own additions are in web-category-additions.json; 'streaming' has no downloaded list, only the additions.",
